      <p>Managira is a comprehensive school management platform that provides digital tools for educational institutions — from individual schools to government bodies managing multiple institutions through our Hub system. Our services include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Student records, enrollment, and academic performance tracking</li>
        <li>Attendance monitoring and automated reporting</li>
        <li>Grade management, assessment creation, and merit sheet generation</li>
        <li>Parent and guardian portals for real-time school updates</li>
        <li>Hub management for overseeing multiple schools from a single dashboard</li>
        <li>Customizable branding, public-facing school websites, and organizational tools</li>
      </ul>
