        <li>Schools and hub operators can export their data at any time.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">5</span> Privacy</h2>
      <p>Your data is handled in accordance with our <a href="/legal/privacy-policy" style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;">Privacy Policy</a>. By using Managira, you consent to the collection, use, and processing of your information as outlined therein. We are committed to protecting student data and comply with international standards including GDPR and FERPA.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">6</span> Payment and Fees</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Certain features require a paid subscription. Plans are available for individual schools and hub operators managing multiple institutions.</li>
        <li>All fees are non-refundable unless otherwise stated.</li>
