        <li>Hub-managed schools may have their billing handled centrally by the hub operator.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">7</span> Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Managira is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied.</li>
        <li>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Managira shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use or inability to use the platform.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">8</span> Termination</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms, engage in unauthorized activities, or compromise the security and integrity of the platform. Upon termination, your data may be archived or deleted in accordance with our data retention policies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">9</span> Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update or modify these Terms from time to time. Users will be notified of significant changes. Continued use of Managira after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@managira.com">support@managira.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>